# Direct dependencies for the frozen Desktop core Gateway runtime.
#
# Update these intentionally, then refresh requirements-runtime.lock in a clean
# sidecar environment. Optional browser, MCP, TUI, and vector-memory
# dependencies stay outside the built-in runtime.
#
# Security floors: aiohttp>=3.14.5, Markdown>=3.8.1, python-dotenv>=1.2.2.
# Never pin below these; they close the open GitHub security advisories.
